Manage layered Strap artifacts.

Usage:
  strap artifact types
  strap artifact roots
  strap artifact status [command|tool|porcelain] [--paths]
  strap artifact workon command my-command
  strap artifact promote tool my_tool
  strap artifact promote tool my_tool --from project --to global
  strap artifact discard porcelain draft

Layer order is session, user, project, global, root. `workon` writes to the session layer when `STRAP_SESSION` is set, otherwise to the user layer. `promote` moves one layer down by default: session to user, user to project, project to global, global to root. Use `--from` and `--to` for explicit layer moves.
